00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:57.615
the impression, they don't really
understand you, that's very unsatisfying.

00:13:57.615 --> 00:13:59.265
That's not a good feeling.

00:13:59.485 --> 00:14:01.725
Whereas I can talk to you as
soon as I want and you can

00:14:01.725 --> 00:14:02.615
understand everything I say.

00:14:03.265 --> 00:14:06.075
That is, that's very, very good.

00:14:06.435 --> 00:14:07.935
And you have definitely improved.

00:14:07.935 --> 00:14:10.465
So no matter how good we
are, we can always improve.

00:14:10.495 --> 00:14:11.585
That's the other message.

00:14:11.905 --> 00:14:12.335
Yeah.

00:14:12.945 --> 00:14:18.855
And I know that as a non-native speaker, I
will always be improving as long as I uh,

00:14:18.855 --> 00:14:24.855
study English, I will always be getting
better and also actually recording myself,

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:30.165
like having all of those videos or even
like quick audio messages that I sent to

00:14:30.165 --> 00:14:34.995
other people that I can later refer to
motivates me a lot because I'm like, oh

00:14:34.995 --> 00:14:37.574
my God, a year ago I sounded like this.

00:14:37.574 --> 00:14:41.954
Like I didn't know all of these words,
but now I feel so much more confident.

00:14:42.225 --> 00:14:43.635
I speak a lot faster.

00:14:43.635 --> 00:14:45.465
I know all of these words.

00:14:45.915 --> 00:14:51.495
So yeah, like having all of those,
uh, videos and all of those references

00:14:51.495 --> 00:14:55.705
really does help me, like motivate
me to study English even more.

00:14:56.655 --> 00:14:58.905
And you know, it's not only the
fact that you know all these

00:14:58.905 --> 00:15:02.829
words, the way you assemble your
words is in the correct order.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:08.040
Uh, so many people, and it, it,
that's more important than accent

00:15:08.069 --> 00:15:14.400
is, is having a sentence structure
with the odd clause buried in another

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.010
clause, but yet everything is English.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:20.370
It's not Russian, or it's
not German or Chinese.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.650
It's, it's actually a
hundred percent English.

00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:22.979
Yes.

00:15:22.979 --> 00:15:24.599
So, congratulations.

00:15:24.689 --> 00:15:25.329
Thank you.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:26.729
All right.

00:15:26.729 --> 00:15:27.740
Thank you, Veronika.

00:15:27.755 --> 00:15:28.530
Nice chatting.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.099
Thank you.

